ontal and vertical scalability, strong consistency, and high performance."],"features":["Distributed Transactions: TiDB uses a two-phase commit protocol to ensure ACID compliance, providing strong consistency. Transactions span multiple nodes, and TiDB's distributed nature ensures data correctness even in…","Horizontal and Vertical Scalability: TiDB can be scaled horizontally by adding more nodes or vertically by increasing resources of existing nodes, all without downtime. TiDB's architecture separates computing from…","High Availability: Built-in Raft consensus protocol ensures reliability and automated failover. Data is stored in multiple replicas, and transactions are committed only after writing to the majority of replicas,…","Hybrid Transactional/Analytical Processing (HTAP): TiDB provides two storage engines: TiKV, a row-based storage engine, and TiFlash, a columnar storage engine. TiFlash uses the Multi-Raft Learner protocol to replicate…","Cloud-Native: TiDB can be deployed in public clouds, on-premises, or natively in Kubernetes. TiDB Operator helps manage TiDB on Kubernetes, automating cluster operations, while TiDB Cloud provides a fully-managed…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pingcap/tidb/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"4988138b06f27ec24f2853882e7bfa7cec7a52efae9137313fec7d8f4ce9d5b0","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:01:33.655Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:44:08.894Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T18:01:11Z","previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T18:49:05.661Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://play.tidbcloud.com/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb_readme","attemptedAt":"2026-10-07T18:49:05.661Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T18:49:05.661Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-07T18:49:05.661Z","target":"https://play.tidbcloud.com/scalability?utm_source=github&utm_medium=tidb_readme","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-14T18:49:05.661Z","consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"probeVersion":3},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"TiDB (